            "description": {
              "value": "You ignite a pinch of black powder in a foe's face. Choose an adjacent creature. It must attempt a Fortitude save against your class DC.\n\nCritical Success: The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess: The creature is dazzled for 1 round.\nFailure: The creature is blinded for 1 round and dazzled for 1 minute. The creature can rub its eyes as an Interact action to end this blinded condition.\nCritical Failure: The creature is blinded for 1 round and dazzled for 1 hour."
            }
          }
        }
